ur</span> <span begin="00:39.256" end="00:39.811">vi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们该如何</span></p><p begin="00:40.325" end="00:41.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:40.325" end="00:40.533">Mitt</span> <span begin="00:40.533" end="00:40.626">i</span> <span begin="00:40.626" end="00:40.878">nat</span><span begin="00:40.878" end="00:41.421">ten</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:41.421" end="00:42.623"><span begin="00:41.421" end="00:41.586">(Mitt</span> <span begin="00:41.586" end="00:41.750">i</span> <span begin="00:41.750" end="00:41.988">nat</span><span begin="00:41.988" end="00:42.623">ten)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">度过这漫漫长夜</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">度过这漫漫长夜</span></p><p begin="00:42.816" end="00:44.117" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:42.816" end="00:43.051">Är</span> <span begin="00:43.051" end="00:43.604">vak</span><span begin="00:43.604" end="00:44.117">na</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">从梦中醒来</span></p><p begin="00:44.422" end="00:45.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:44.422" end="00:44.714">O</span> <span begin="00:44.714" end="00:44.854">pra</span><span begin="00:44.854" end="00:45.041">tar</span> <span begin="00:45.041" end="00:45.256">om</span> <span begin="00:45.256" end="00:45.794">nu</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:45.794" end="00:46.922"><span begin="00:45.794" end="00:45.934">(Pra</span><span begin="00:45.934" end="00:46.084">tar</span> <span begin="00:46.084" end="00:46.406">om</span> <span begin="00:46.406" end="00:46.922">hur)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">谈论一下如何</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哦，现在谈谈吧</span></p><p begin="00:47.495" end="00:48.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:47.495" end="00:48.022">Det</span> <span begin="00:48.022" end="00:48.549">var</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是</s